<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan United Micro sets 1997 targets.</title>
<headline>Taiwan United Micro sets 1997 targets.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Microelectronics Corp, Taiwan's second largest semiconductor maker, has set its 1997 net profit target at T$8.24 billion, up 7.7 percent from 1996, a company statement said on Friday.</p>
<p>It forecast a 1997 sales at T$26.84 billion.</p>
<p>In 1996, United Microelectronics reported a net profit of T$7.65 billion on turnover of T$22.61 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
